id: BUILD-005
ilities: [modularity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: advisory
title: Server-only env var in client code
category: build
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .tsx .jsx
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: process.env
patterns:
  - regex: process\.env\.(DATABASE|DB_HOST|DB_PASS|DB_USER|DB_NAME|DB_PORT|DB_URL)
    message: "Database env var in client component — server-only variables are undefined in the browser"
  - regex: process\.env\.(SECRET|PRIVATE_KEY|API_SECRET|JWT_SECRET|STRIPE_SECRET|AUTH_SECRET)
    message: "Secret env var in client component — only NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars are available in the browser"
  - regex: process\.env\.(AWS_|REDIS_|MONGO_|SMTP_|SENDGRID_|TWILIO_)
    message: "Infrastructure env var in client component — server-only variables leak in client bundle"
fix: Use NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix for client-visible vars, or move logic to a server component or API route.
